    "0": {
      "protagonist_growth": "Chen Ji transformed from a discarded sect废物 (waste) son publicly humiliated by fellow disciples into a black horse in the sect competition who could crush his rivals. During this arc he unlocked the turtle shell artifact, sensed his bloodline connection, and ultimately activated the 天机录 for the first time, which dramatically elevated his spiritual cultivation to a level that attracted the attention of cosmic-level forces.",
      "relationship_changes": [
        {
          "characters": [
            "陈机",
            "陈父(亡)"
          ],
          "change": "Chen Ji discovered crucial clues about his father's death, shifting from mourning an absent father to actively pursuing revenge against those responsible."
        },
        {
          "characters": [
            "陈机",
            "宗门某女弟子"
          ],
          "change": "A fellow disciple who previously humiliated Chen Ji during the sect competition later showed genuine care during the 山雨欲来 crisis, marking a turning point from hostility to uncertain alliance."
        },
        {
          "characters": [
            "陈机",
            "暗中相助的势力"
          ],
          "change": "Chen Ji discovered someone had been secretly helping him throughout the arc, shifting from suspicion to cautious acceptance of an unknown benefactor's scheming."
        }
      ],
      "unresolved_threads": [
        "The identity and motives of the power that secretly helped Chen Ji and made arrangements on his behalf",
        "The truth behind Chen Ji's father's death and who truly killed him",
        "The meaning of the turtle shell artifact's connection to the 天机录",
        "The reason the Heavenly Dao's Eye suddenly focused on Chen Ji at this moment",
        "The mastermind behind the 退婚之辱 humiliation"
      ],
      "power_level_summary": "Chen Ji's cultivation has surged from the bottom of the Qi Refining stage to mid-stage Foundation Establishment within this arc. The activation of 天机录 has unlocked an unknown tier of power, but its full extent remains unclear and potentially attracts dangerous attention.",
      "next_arc_setup": "The Heavenly Dao's Eye has turned its gaze upon Chen Ji, a being of supreme consciousness that views him as an ant daring to play the role of chess master. This ominous attention guarantees that the forces behind the scenes will no longer remain passive observers, and the mastermind behind Chen Ji's humiliation will surely escalate their schemes.",
