    "1": {
      "protagonist_growth": "Chen Ji transformed from a humiliated disciple into a cultivator who mastered the 天机录's predictive abilities, gaining the power to foresee events (首次预见). His bloodline became strong enough to awaken the turtle shell artifact's connection to the heavens, enabling him to sense heavenly secrets. He also exposed his cultivation breakthrough, shifting from a concealed genius to someone openly targeted by multiple powerful factions.",
