      "next_arc_setup": "The Heavenly Dao's Eye has directly锁定 Chen Ji, signaling that higher powers have taken interest in him as either a threat or asset. Meanwhile, the Five Elders' conspiracy, Su Qingyao's mysterious involvement, and the approaching deadline of the退婚 mastermind's response create multiple converging threats that will test whether Chen Ji can survive as a marked individual in the cultivation world.",
